    "overview": "Donatex lives in the dark room behind a livestream — phone glow on the donor's face, OBS canvas waiting for the next moment. The donor page is a fast, legible lane: dark tinted neutrals, mint accent for action, no corporate polish. The overlay is the spotlight burst when payment lands. Personality is indie and intentional, not a templated creator-tip clone.",
